r to specify the config format."],[1824,"GET /sources/{key}/transforms: source transforms to be applied to the fields."],[1732,"GET /stats on the HTTP API returns a JSON snapshot of the runtime: version, process ID, CPU and memory usage (cgroup-aware in containers), uptime, the source/sink totals, and a connectors array with per-connector details - key, name, type, plugin version, enabled, message counters, error count, and the current status."],[1802,"GET /stats: runtime statistics (process info plus per-connector status and message counters)."],[1784,"Get active configs: GET {base_url}/configs/active"],[1790,"Get active sink config: GET {base_url}/sinks/{key}/configs/active"],[1793,"Get active source config: GET {base_url}/sources/{key}/configs/active"],[1785,"Get active versions: GET {base_url}/configs/active/versions"],[4112,"GET and HEAD are accepted but unusual for delivering data: the request still carries a body, which some servers reject. The sink logs a warning at startup when GET or HEAD is combined with a batch mode other than individual."],[448,"Get client. Code: 21."],[449,"Get clients. Code: 22. Empty payload."],[444,"Get cluster metadata. Code: 12. Empty payload."],[125,"Get consumer group details"],[492,"Get consumer group. Code: 600."],[493,"Get consumer groups. Code: 601."],[478,"Get consumer offset. Code: 120."],[447,"Get me. Code: 20. Empty payload."],[514,"Get personal access tokens. Code: 41. Empty payload."],[3325,"Get server stats"],[1789,"Get sink config by version: GET {base_url}/sinks/{key}/configs/{version}"],[1788,"Get sink configs: GET {base_url}/sinks/{key}/configs"],[442,"Get snapshot. Code: 11."],[1792,"Get source config by version: GET {base_url}/sources/{key}/configs/{version}"],[1791,"Get source configs: GET {base_url}/sources/{key}/configs"],[71,"Get specific client details"],[441,"Get stats. Code: 10. Empty payload."],[133,"Get stored consumer offset"],[83,"Get stream details"],[3335,"Get stream, list streams"],[450,"Get stream